# Docgen

- `APP_NAME = "Docgen"` in `backend/app/__init__.py`
- Read `AGENTS.md` and `memory-bank/*` before substantive work
- Work phase by phase; do not start Phase N+1 until Phase N gates pass
- LLM never controls layout/colors; Format-only never accepts free LLM text
- Prefer content fidelity, WCAG AA, determinism
- No features outside AGENTS.md until acceptance criteria pass

